  "description": "**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=814298), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10077766)\n\nA love that compromises with reality. you and me.\n\nGather the lanseon butlers!! The more you look, the cuter the background\n\nAs he has been dating his lover Minjoo for a year, the ideal type of his dreams still exists. However, I live my life thinking that it is impossible to have a relationship with my ideal type. One day, you get a machine that is said to make your ideal type...",
